and a patch for NH340 from Aardvark) that you might want to take a look
at.

I think Aardvark encoded the conducts into a number that he added to the
logfile entry. ->  http://www.u.arizona.edu/~minch/

I myself added the conduct information as a string to the logfile entry
(for ascensions only).

It e.g. looks like:
   "ascended nude vegan pacifist"                   (in the logfile)
   "Patito-Mon-Hum-Mal-Cha the nude vegan pacifist  (in the highscore)
    ascended to demigod-hood."


Below I'll add the code that does that. So if you want to put some more
work into this, feel free to use it. (Or tell me what you need, I can
hopefully take care of it)

